# The three modes (ARP). PLAY: the white keys play VOX in the scene's key, the generator leaves VOX to
# you. GUIDE: the generator plays VOX too, and held keys steer it. DRIFT: a white key is a scene, and the
# director travels there (the next scene's key comes in at the middle of the travel).
wait 1000
expect mode 0
expect jr_playing 1
tapkey w0
wait 100
expect vox 1
wait 12000
expect vox_notes 0
tap ARP
expect mode 1
wait 20000
expect vox_notes >2
key w9 down
key w11 down
wait 12000
expect line_notes >5
key w9 up
key w11 up
tap ARP
expect mode 2
tapkey w2
wait 200
expect travelling 1
shot drift.png
leds
wait 30000
expect scene 3
tap ARP
expect mode 0
expect clips 0
